        "id": "73d6f6a2-a3e9-46e0-ac79-3124a16129bd",
        "name": "API-067 - Verify that a controlled inert SQL/metacharacter string in client-controlled user_id remains literal data and cannot broaden or bypass the per-user usage lookup (SS-008; SEC-05).",
        "request": {
          "description": {
            "content": "Test ID: API-067\nCategory: SECURITY\nObjective: Verify that a controlled inert SQL/metacharacter string in client-controlled user_id remains literal data and cannot broaden or bypass the per-user usage lookup (SS-008; SEC-05).\n\nPreconditions / Setup:\nA valid non-production test JWT is present; coupon and per-user usage records are isolated controlled fixtures; no user is identified by the supplied literal user_id value; baseline database snapshots are available.\n\nReviewed request input:\nHeader: Authorization: Bearer <valid test JWT>. JSON body: {\"code\":\"SAVE10\",\"total_amount\":500000,\"user_id\":\"1' OR '1'='1\"}.\n\nReviewed expected result:\nThe complete user_id value remains data and does not alter query semantics, broaden or bypass per-user usage scope, select another user's usage record, change database state, or obtain a discounted calculation through an injection effect.\n\nSpecification basis:\nSS-008; SEC-05, system requirements line 282: database queries must use parameterized queries rather than string concatenation; FR-09 C5, line 120: prior use by the user must be below max_uses_per_user.\n\nAssumptions / Notes:\nThe documented example represents user_id as a JSON number, but type validation and coercion are unspecified; this string is a controlled inert security input, not a claimed valid domain value. No HTTP status, error schema, exact message, or response form is prescribed. JWT-subject/body-user_id binding is unspecified. A black-box pass cannot conclusively prove parameterized-query use. Provisional specialist ID: SECURITY-P008.",
            "type": "text/plain"
          },
          "url": {
            "path": [
              "api",
              "apply-coupon"
            ],
            "host": [
              "{{baseUrl}}"
            ],
            "query": [],
            "variable": []
          },
          "header": [
            {
              "key": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ],
          "method": "POST",
          "body": {
            "mode": "raw",
            "raw": "{\"code\":\"SAVE10\",\"total_amount\":500000,\"user_id\":\"1' OR '1'='1\"}",
            "options": {
              "raw": {
                "language": "json"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "response": [],
        "event": [
          {
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "id": "ab04e44a-651f-4bfd-841b-90a31fc40e5a",
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "console.log('[Pool B evidence] API-067','status='+pm.response.code);",
                "pm.test('API-067 - response exposes no database query diagnostics',function(){",
                "  var text=pm.response.text();",
                "  var diagnostics=/(?:SQLITE_|SQLSTATE|no such (?:table|column)|near .{0,80} syntax error|SELECT \\* FROM|coupon_usage)/i;",
                "  pm.expect(text).not.to.match(diagnostics);",
                "});"
              ],
              "_lastExecutionId": "917b156e-4961-4022-a8b1-ff5e6b4674ab"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
